    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>NightMaze</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all started as a harmless urban exploration in the sewers\u2026 until the gate slammed shut behind you. Don\u2019t panic: there\u2019s a ladder! Unfortunately, it leads straight into a ruined medieval castle\u2026 and a cursed village where everyone has turned into hungry zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Find the key, dodge the castle\u2019s traps, grab whatever loot you can, and survive the final nightmare: a shifting labyrinth crawling with the undead. Somewhere between panic attacks and nervous laughter, things will get messy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong>:<br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Procedural Labyrinth</strong> \u2013 Every run is randomly generated, no two escapes are the same.<br>\ud83e\udddf <strong>Reactive Monsters</strong> \u2013 They hunt using sight, sound, and your every mistake.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Loot &amp; Survive</strong> \u2013 Scavenge weapons, gear, and weird items that might just save you.<br>\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Horror meets dark humor</strong> \u2013 Terrifying and hilarious, all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Join the Discord for updates, feedback, and screams:<br></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>NightMaze</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all started as a harmless urban exploration in the sewers\u2026 until the gate slammed shut behind you. Don\u2019t panic: there\u2019s a ladder! Unfortunately, it leads straight into a ruined medieval castle\u2026 and a cursed village where everyone has turned into hungry zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission? Find the key, dodge the castle\u2019s traps, grab whatever loot you can, and survive the final nightmare: a shifting labyrinth crawling with the undead. Somewhere between panic attacks and nervous laughter, things will get messy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f <strong>Key Features</strong>:<br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Procedural Labyrinth</strong> \u2013 Every run is randomly generated, no two escapes are the same.<br>\ud83e\udddf <strong>Reactive Monsters</strong> \u2013 They hunt using sight, sound, and your every mistake.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Loot &amp; Survive</strong> \u2013 Scavenge weapons, gear, and weird items that might just save you.<br>\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Horror meets dark humor</strong> \u2013 Terrifying and hilarious, all at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Join the Discord for updates, feedback, and screams:<br></p>",
